  "worked_solution": "The elements of the given set are the natural numbers that satisfy the inequality $|n+6|\\le 1.$ So, we first need to solve for $n:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|n+6|<1 \\\\ -1<n+6<1 \\\\ -7<n<-5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe above inequality does not have natural solutions.\n\nTherefore, the set $A$ is a null set:\n\n$$\nA=\u2205.\n$$",
